MEMORANDUM

TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:
TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:
April 7, 2026
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-17-26 for furnishing Bituminous Asphalt Hot
Mix, Tack Oil, and Cold Mix on an annual basis, for the City of Cheyenne,
Street & Alley Division

Two (2) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The Two (2) bids were received from:

1.
JTL Group Inc. d/b/a Knife River (Cheyenne, WY)
2.
Simon Contractors (Cheyenne, WY)

The bids were reviewed by Bill Gonzalez (Street & Alley), Mike Schlabs (Street & Alley),
and Vicki Nemecek (Public Works).

Their recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive Bids for each Product.
1. Simon Contractors for the purchase of:
a. Bituminous Asphalt Hot Mix ($427,500.00)
b. Cold Mix ($68,250.00)
i. Total = $495,750.00

2. JTL Group Inc. d/b/a Knife River for the purchase of:
a. Tack Oil ($37,500.00)
i. Total = $37,500.00

The total requested bid award for both Bidders is $533,250.00.

Funding:
020-26-2616-42-32302 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Asphalt)

$533,250.00
```

